.TH pcx 1  "pcx 0.1.1"
.SH NAME
pcx \- Inspect and reduce point\-cloud recordings on edge Linux systems
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBpcx\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fB\-V\fR|\fB\-\-version\fR] [\fIsubcommands\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Inspect and reduce point\-cloud recordings on edge Linux systems.
.PP
Inspect MCAP metadata and Topics, extract one ROS 2 PointCloud2 frame to PCD, or copy one selected encoded message into a reduced MCAP.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help (see a summary with \*(Aq\-h\*(Aq)
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
pcx\-info(1)
Show MCAP container metadata without decoding point frames
.TP
pcx\-topics(1)
Discover Topics, MCAP Channels, Schemas, and message counts
.TP
pcx\-extract(1)
Extract exactly one ROS 2 PointCloud2 Point Frame as PCD
.TP
pcx\-passthrough(1)
Copy one selected encoded message into a faithful reduced MCAP
.SH VERSION
v0.1.1
